NOTICE - third party specification documents
============================================

This directory holds specification documents written by other people. They are
vendored here as test fixtures for the OPENREF specification corpus, per SPEC 21.
Nothing here is part of any published OPENREF package: these files do not ship in a
tarball, are not linked into any consumer's code, and carry no obligation into it.

This NOTICE exists because attribution has to travel with the material. `manifest.json`
next to it carries the same facts in machine readable form, and the license gate checks
that the two agree. A manifest line detaches the moment a file is copied out of this
directory on its own; a NOTICE in the directory does not.

Each document below is listed with its source, the date it was retrieved, its license,
its copyright holder, and whether OPENREF modified it. Under CC-BY-4.0 a modification
must be indicated, so truncating a document or repairing invalid YAML is recorded as a
modification with a description of what was done.

The documents are unmodified unless the entry says otherwise. OPENREF claims no
copyright in any of them, and their licenses are not changed by their presence here.

